  "details": "UdonBehaviour has `HasError` that becomes true if the Udon got an error, but it is not exposed for Udon. Currently checking `enabled` becomes false is the only way to detect if an Udon has error, but it cannot distinguish `enabled = false` is by user or by Udon error.\n\nUsing `HasError` will helps tracking bugs about user-created Udons, so I thought `HasError` should be exposed.",
